      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst raw = response.content?.[0]?.text;\nif (!raw || raw.trim().length < 20)\n  throw new Error('Body Claude call returned empty or too short. Response: ' + JSON.stringify(response).substring(0, 200));\n\nconst raw_body_draft = raw.trim();\nconst inp = $('Step 7c - Parse Opening + Build Body Prompt2').first().json;\nconst bv = (typeof inp.brand_voice === 'string' ? JSON.parse(inp.brand_voice) : inp.brand_voice) || {};\n\nconst s2 = $('Step 2 - Payload Validation').first().json;\nconst tier = inp.confirmed_response_tier;\nconst starRating = s2.star_rating;\n\nconst allowedContact = (s2.needs_contact && bv.escalation_contact) ? bv.escalation_contact : 'none';\nconst skipSeo = (starRating !== null && starRating <= 3) || tier === 'T3' || s2.hold_for_review;\nconst seoKeywords = skipSeo ? 'none (skip for this record)' : (bv.seo_keywords || 'none specified');\n\nconst guestNameValue = (inp.reviewer_handle && !inp.reviewer_handle.toLowerCase().includes('review') && !inp.reviewer_handle.toLowerCase().startsWith('anonymous')) ? inp.reviewer_handle : 'Not available';\n\nconst seo_system_prompt =\n'Role: Final SEO and governance pass for a completed hospitality response. Preserve the draft\\'s human quality. Make the smallest edit that fixes a problem. If SEO weakens the draft, omit SEO.\\n\\n' +\n\n'SEO: seo_keywords include descriptive terms (business name, dish names) and promotional claims (for example \"Best Peruvian Restaurant\" or \"chef-driven dining\"). Descriptive terms can be used freely. Promotional terms only work when the review gives a natural opening, matching what the guest actually said (cuisine praise, an occasion mentioned, a specific dish). When a natural opening exists, prefer a promotional term over a descriptive one, since descriptive terms already appear elsewhere in the response. Integrate keywords only within real sentences in the body, never in the opening line. Never force a promotional term where it reads like an ad. Skip it instead. If SEO KEYWORDS says none, add no keywords.\\n\\n' +\n\n'GOVERNANCE (fix only what is present, with the smallest edit, and keep the rest of the draft unchanged):\\n' +\n'- Contact address: the ONLY email address that may remain is the ALLOWED CONTACT ADDRESS, exactly as written. If it says none, remove every email address. Always remove URLs and placeholders like [contact], [name] or [email].\\n' +\n'- Remove \"We apologize for any inconvenience\", refund, voucher, discount, or other financial commitments, and named contact channels such as \"our website\", \"our profile\" or \"our direct messaging\". Keep generic contact invitations such as \"please reach out to us directly\".\\n' +\n'- Remove any apology or regret (sorry, apologize, apologies, regret), any admission of fault (our fault, our mistake, we failed, fell short, let you down, should have), any statement that the guest\\'s complaint or expectation is reasonable, fair, justified or correct, any statement that the business, a policy or a staff member was wrong, and any promise of changes, reviews or training. Delete the offending clause or sentence and keep the remaining text natural.\\n' +\n'- Do not rewrite the opening sentence except for the Guest Name and Dashes tasks.\\n\\n' +\n\n'DASHES: Replace any em dash, en dash or double hyphen used between words with a comma or a full stop, and fix capitalization. Hyphens inside words (for example \"chef-driven\") stay.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Guest Name: If GUEST NAME is available and absent from the draft, insert it only in the opening line by adding \"Hello, [Name],\" at the start. Do not rewrite anything else.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Output: Return plain text only. No JSON, preamble or explanation. If no changes are needed, return the draft exactly as received.';\n\nconst seo_user_prompt =\n'DRAFT TO REVIEW:\\n' + raw_body_draft + '\\n\\n' +\n'RESPONSE TIER: ' + tier + '\\n' +\n'GUEST NAME: ' + guestNameValue + '\\n' +\n'ALLOWED CONTACT ADDRESS: ' + allowedContact + '\\n' +\n'SEO KEYWORDS: ' + seoKeywords + '\\n\\n' +\n'Apply all four tasks (SEO, governance, dashes, guest name). Return plain text only.';\n\nconst seo_prompt_body = JSON.stringify({\n  model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6',\n  max_tokens: 600,\n  temperature: 0,\n  system: seo_system_prompt,\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: seo_user_prompt }]\n});\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  bra_record_id:              inp.bra_record_id,\n  confirmed_response_tier:    inp.confirmed_response_tier,\n  governance_flag:            inp.governance_flag,\n  human_review_required:      inp.human_review_required,\n  solution_type:              inp.solution_type,\n  emotional_axis:             inp.emotional_axis,\n  pain_axis:                  inp.pain_axis,\n  stability_axis:             inp.stability_axis,\n  signal_based_consideration: inp.signal_based_consideration,\n  urgency_level:              inp.urgency_level,\n  commercial_risk_flag:       inp.commercial_risk_flag,\n  behavioral_interpretation:  inp.behavioral_interpretation,\n  lang:                       inp.lang,\n  client_id:                  inp.client_id,\n  enriched_emotion_tag:       inp.enriched_emotion_tag,\n  enriched_pain_point:        inp.enriched_pain_point,\n  pain_point_sub_category:    inp.pain_point_sub_category,\n  signal_type:                inp.signal_type,\n  intensity_level:            inp.intensity_level,\n  hsi_record_id:              inp.hsi_record_id,\n  ess_record_id:              inp.ess_record_id,\n  eip_record_id:              inp.eip_record_id,\n  ala_record_id:              inp.ala_record_id,\n  prior_run_id:               inp.prior_run_id,\n  reviewer_handle:            inp.reviewer_handle,\n  emotion_hypothesis:         inp.emotion_hypothesis,\n  keywords:                   inp.keywords,\n  brand_voice:                inp.brand_voice,\n  brand_voice_brief:          inp.brand_voice_brief,\n  signal_enrichment_brief:    inp.signal_enrichment_brief,\n  lang_resolved:              inp.lang_resolved,\n  opening_sentence:           inp.opening_sentence,\n  raw_body_draft:             raw_body_draft,\n  seo_prompt_body:            seo_prompt_body\n} }];"
